            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Open Transaction Monitoring Page</p>
            <p>Opens a Transaction Monitoring page and verifies correct URL, page heading, and successful page load.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> index = route.index, expectedPath = route.route, expectedText = route.assertion.</p>
            <step>Visit /main/dashboard.</step>
            <step>Pin the sidebar if unpin icon is visible.</step>
            <step>Click Processes → Transaction Monitoring and select the submenu item by index.</step>
